            <ArticleTitle>[A global approach to therapeutic education for patients with schizophrenia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>41-44</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0241-6972(17)30140-8</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.spsy.2017.09.009</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Thanks to the wealth of multiple competencies, it is now possible to undertake a global approach with the patient with schizophrenia based on therapeutic education. An 'à la carte' evolutive programme can respond to the issues inherent to this disorder, on condition that the caregivers have developed a common culture and values. An example of a programme implemented in La Chartreuse hospital in Dijon.</AbstractText>
